  X.conjTranspose * ((A.fromRows L).conjTranspose * A.fromRows L) * X = Matrix.diagonal fun i => ↑(c i ^ 2 + s i ^ 2)

NLAlib.IsNormalizedGSVD.tendsto_generalTikhonovFilter_zero.{u_1, u_2, u_3, u_4} {𝕜 : Type u_1} [RCLike 𝕜] {m : Type u_2}
