doc:
A convex combination of sketch row-space projectors is a contraction in
the quadratic-form sense: `vᵀ W v ≤ ‖v‖²`. Gower–Richtárik 2015, equation (4.1);
atlas `sketch-and-project` (expected-projector helper).

signature:
NLAlib.SketchProject.expErr_le.{u_1, u_2, u_3, u_4} {m : Type u_1} {n : Type u_2} {s : Type u_3} {J : Type u_4}
  [Fintype m] [Fintype n] [Fintype s] [Fintype J] (A : Matrix m n ℝ) (b : m → ℝ) (p : J → ℝ) (hp : ∀ (j : J), 0 ≤ p j)
  (hp1 : ∑ j, p j = 1) (S : J → Matrix m s ℝ) {xs : n → ℝ} (hxs : A.mulVec xs = b) {lam : ℝ}
  (hlam : ∀ (v : n → ℝ), lam * v ⬝ᵥ v ≤ v ⬝ᵥ (NLAlib.SketchProject.expectedProjector A p S).mulVec v) (x : n → ℝ)
  (k : ℕ) : NLAlib.SketchProject.expErr A b p S xs x k ≤ (1 - lam) ^ k * (x - xs) ⬝ᵥ (x - xs)

