          R (Y₀ q) * d q * R (Y₀ q) - R (Y₁ q) * d q * R (Y₁ q) ∂(NLAlib.resamplingTripleMeasure ν).prod γ -
      (↑(Fintype.card ι) / 4) •
        ∫ (q : (ι × (ι × Fin 3 → n × n ⊕ n × n → ℝ)) × (n × n ⊕ n × n → ℝ)),
          2 • (R (Y₂ q) * d q * R (Y₂ q) * d q * R (Y₂ q)) ∂(NLAlib.resamplingTripleMeasure ν).prod γ)
    t

